Saphira network-host group
===========================

Installing this package installs a working Saphira network-host
stack: the static network configuration framework, Open vSwitch
tooling and a DHCP client.

This package carries no payload of its own beyond this file. The
authoritative member list is the `depends` field of this package's
APK metadata (`apk info -a saphira-network-host`). Profiles and
image definitions must name the group, never re-enumerate its
closure.
